kind":"event","title":{"zh":"信号传输接入","en":"Incoming Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"更多的即将到来……我们必须封闭这个裂缝……我们是唯一剩下的人……","en":"more are coming... we must seal this rift... we are all that remains..."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"astral_planes.3020.a","label":{"zh":"更多的即将到来？","en":"More are coming?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"situations:situation_the_seal","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/astral_planes_events.txt:2078","story":"event-astral-planes-3010"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/astral_planes_events.txt","line":2059}},{"id":"situations:situation_the_seal","kind":"situation","title":{"zh":"封印","en":"The Seal"},"texts":[{"zh":"星系中心的居民目前遭受一股未知势力的攻击，他们请求我们的帮助。如果他们失败，我们或许就再也无法知晓自己的命运。","en":"Under assault from an unknown force, the entities currently inhabiting the center of the galaxy have requested our assistance. Should they fall, we know not our fate."}],"sections":[{"zh":"按兵不动","en":"Do Nothing"},{"zh":"编织星界纤维","en":"Weave Astral Fabric"},{"zh":"泵出异星天然气","en":"Pump Exotic Gases"},{"zh":"我们不进行干涉，任由冲突演变。","en":"We will let this conflict proceed without interference."},{"zh":"如果我们将自己回收的星界丝缕交给这些存在，他们可以用它来加强自己的护盾。","en":"If we were to deliver our recovered astral thread to these beings, they could use it to fortify their shielding."},{"zh":"异星天然气在这个存在的古怪泡泡中有放大效果。我们可以利用它来增强我们的武器。","en":"Exotic gases have amplified effects in this strange bubble of existence. We can use it to enhance our weaponry."},{"zh":"我们必须消灭最后的入侵者，才能让无形异使正确地封印[Root.Target.GetName]恒星系。","en":"We must eliminate the last of the invaders for the Formless to properly seal the [Root.Target.GetName] system"}],"image":"art/6d5764095d7d0ebdfa03.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"astral_planes.50","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"1"}],"through":["astral_situation.15"],"source":"common/situations/06_astral_planes_situations.txt:394","hooks":["on_progress_complete","immediate"],"sets":["the_formless_seal_is_set"],"story":"event-astral-planes-3010"},{"target":"astral_planes.3100","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"1"}],"through":["astral_situation.15","astral_planes.3099"],"source":"common/situations/06_astral_planes_situations.txt:394","hooks":["on_progress_complete","immediate","immediate"],"sets":["saved_formless","the_formless_seal_is_set"],"story":"event-astral-planes-3010"}],"source":{"file":"common/situations/06_astral_planes_situations.txt","line":357}},{"id":"astral_planes.50","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"古怪虫洞","en":"Strange Wormhole"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在[crystal_sphere_system.GetName]恒星系中发现的异常虫洞正在剧烈波动。传感器检测到它是通往星系中心的直接通道。\n\n这怎么可能？","en":"The anomalous wormhole we discovered in the [crystal_sphere_system.GetName] system is fluctuating wildly. Sensors detect it is a direct pathway to the center of the galaxy.\n\nHow is that possible?"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/63a2a8805384dfff0104.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"INTERESTING","label":{"zh":"真是有趣。","en":"Interesting."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/astral_planes_events.txt","line":1207},"names":{"crystal_sphere_system.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"astral_planes.3100","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"无形异使","en":"The Formless"},"texts":[{"zh":"在不断变化的状态下，这个实体的可见形态在这个现实和另一个现实之间转换。祂的声音共鸣如众多的和声，仿佛同时代表着几个存在。\n\n……完成了……封印已经设置完毕……我们的孩子再也找不到这个地方了……","en":"In a constant state of flux, this entity's visible form shifts between this reality and another. Their voice resonates as a harmonic multitude, as speaking on behalf of several beings at once.\n\n... it is done... the seal is set... never shall our children find this place again..."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3c986058dcd6900a1454.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"astral_planes.3100.a","label":{"zh":"你是什么？","en":"What are you?"},"responses":[{"zh":"你知道我们……我们超越了裂缝……也属于裂缝……你已经见过了……","en":"you know us... we are beyond the rifts... and of the rifts... you have seen..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["formless_lore_dialog_step_1"]},{"key":"astral_planes.3100.b","label":{"zh":"为什么你会在这？","en":"Why are you here?"},"responses":[{"zh":"我们的孩子……破碎的孩子……追捕我们……他们寻找王座……我们隐藏它……","en":"our children... broken children... hunt us... they seek the throne... we hide it..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"formless_lore_dialog_step_1","path":"","value":true}]],"sets":["formless_lore_dialog_step_2"]},{"key":"astral_planes.3100.c","label":{"zh":"什么是“王座”？","en":"What is this \"Throne?\""},"responses":[{"zh":"我们的永恒……我们的回忆……如果我们是血液……那就是心脏……现在安全了……我们感谢你……","en":"our eternity... our memories... if we are the blood... it is the heart... safe now... we thank you..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"formless_lore_dialog_step_2","path":"","value":true}]],"sets":["formless_lore_dialog_step_3"]},{"key":"astral_planes.3100.d","label":{"zh":"向我们臣服，你们将继续存活。","en":"Serve under us, and you may yet still live."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"无形异使作为一个曙光境成为[This.GetName]治下的附属国。","en":"The Formless becomes a subject under [This.GetName] as a Luminarium."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"astral_planes.3101","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.75,"group":"r1337","modified":true,"source":"events/astral_planes_events.txt:2581","story":"event-astral-planes-3010"},{"target":"astral_planes.3102","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.25,"group":"r1337","source":"events/astral_planes_events.txt:2591","story":"event-astral-planes-3010"}],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"formless_lore_dialog_step_3","path":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"has_any_overlord","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]],"sets":["failed_formless_subjugation","picked_formless_reward_path","picked_formless_subjugation_path"]},{"key":"astral_planes.3100.e","label":{"zh":"将你提到的“王座”交给我们。","en":"Give us this \"Throne\" you speak of."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"astral_planes.3102","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/astral_planes_events.txt:2606","story":"event-astral-planes-3010"}],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"formless_lore_dialog_step_3","path":"","value":true}]],"sets":["picked_formless_reward_path"]},{"key":"astral_planes.3100.f","label":{"zh":"让我们携手合作。","en":"Let's work together."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]],"sets":["allied_with_formless","immune_to_negative_traits","picked_formless_reward_path","returned_to_form_achievement"]},{"key":"GOODBYE","label":{"zh":"再会了。","en":"Goodbye."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/astral_planes_events.txt","line":2464},"names":{"This.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"astral_planes.3101","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"无形异使","en":"The Formless"},"texts":[{"zh":"这已经被预测……我们会向你们称臣……这是我们的命运……","en":"this was predicted... we will serve you... this is our fate..."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["allied_with_formless"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/astral_planes_events.txt","line":2653}},{"id":"astral_planes.3102","